      "questionText": "<p><strong>Complete the sentences, using the words given. You can only use the words once. You may need to change the form of the words.</strong></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; height: 58px;\" border=\"1\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 18.6667px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 25.0489%; height: 18.6667px; text-align: center;\"><strong>hop-on hop-off</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25.0489%; height: 18.6667px; text-align: center;\"><strong>entrance ticket</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25.0489%; height: 18.6667px; text-align: center;\"><strong>ruinous site</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 24.8402%; height: 18.6667px; text-align: center;\"><strong>holidaymaker</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><br>1. Most <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>2.1</label><input id='fbo-911023-0' class='ms fillblank-option-2' index='0' name='fbo-911023-0' type='text' size='17' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-911023-0' /></span></strong>&nbsp;prefer visiting the popular tourist spots in the summer.</p>\n<p>2. I bought a(n) <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>2.2</label><input id='fbo-911023-1' class='ms fillblank-option-2' index='1' name='fbo-911023-1' type='text' size='16' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-911023-1' /></span></strong> for the museum online to skip the long line.</p>\n<p>3. The <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>2.3</label><input id='fbo-911023-2' class='ms fillblank-option-2' index='2' name='fbo-911023-2' type='text' size='17' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-911023-2' /></span> </strong>bus made exploring the city so convenient for tourists.</p>\n<p>4. Many travelers enjoy visiting <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>2.4</label><input id='fbo-911023-3' class='ms fillblank-option-2' index='3' name='fbo-911023-3' type='text' size='15' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-911023-3' /></span></strong> to learn about an