      "explanation": "<div style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 380px; height: 360px;\"><iframe id=\"embed-frame-E21D7\" style=\"border: none;\" src=\"https://azvocab.ai/embed/ST?params=U2FsdGVkX19J8DhK12y9xV7Xv5Na1nYMPzxhiraQAndcCUY04T%2F4Fe4YGCu%2BZkVq1yt0DCmM3wt5h1umwE8VvNHHV0VHB30rMjf77eaZdL2oRXyZUThR17h08jD%2FCOH2y1rhxxOllhJzCS7UAloXBC9lq7FyUOqmcizBNXVgzNPrAMZSUglM9SzuUT7N2EwmGrAoGOGP0zBz3C9YPkFdj6zbzB91eGAelpiYNg8MCLyFZPgaSkddYqV1UPurhQgsAp3ezSBbTix4C8b9BGLL9ij8jxVT2OMKLzu2biwJCRjNxFChyWWYNDtsv0y%2BbJGs5dsx4KdzCcVtyAu8OXFU5NNfJuRdc1ogOtbYCeO%2BMbPO1%2FnzkZzfVYYRAjXFzKhyPBaDoh8bJYPKqBay8964ZT9uqlzX7SbkfJkkUDRfaczgxxEYTpAo5lTM935ztVUD\" width=\"100%\" height=\"360\" frameborder=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></iframe></div>\n<p>Dịch: Gi&aacute; đ&atilde; được cố định n&ecirc;n kh&ocirc;ng c&oacute; chi ph&iacute; ẩn n&agrave;o phải lo lắng trong chuyến tham quan.</p>",
