      "questionType": "FillBlank",
      "questionText": "<p><strong>Read the text and decide which types of tourism are suitable for the students.</strong></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 86.0616%; border-color: #2dc26b; border-style: dashed; height: 202.222px;\" border=\"1\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 202.222px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 100%; height: 202.222px;\">\n<p><strong>Lisa</strong>: I love trips that include exciting outdoor activities like hiking, cycling, or even trying something new like surfing. It&#8217;s fun to push myself and enjoy the outdoors!</p>\n<p><strong>Peter</strong>: For me, traveling is all about busy streets and bright stores. I enjoy finding cool things to buy, like clothes or gadgets, and bringing home bags full of treasures from every trip.</p>\n<p><strong>Daniel</strong>: I prefer quiet places with trees and animals. It&#8217;s relaxing to walk through nature, breathe fresh air, and learn how to take care of the planet while exploring.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><strong><br>Ecotourism - <span class='fillblank-option'><label>14.1</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-14' index='0' name='fbo-910684-0' data-testid='fillblank-select-910684-0'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-910684-0'></option><option value=\"Lisa\" data-testid='fillblank-option-910684-0-Lisa'>Lisa</option><option value=\"Daniel\" data-testid='fillblank-option-910684-0-Daniel'>Daniel</option><option value=\"Peter\" data-testid='fillblank-option-910684-0-Peter'>Peter</option></select></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong>Sports tourism - <span class='fillblank-option'><label>14.2</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-14' index='1' name='fbo-910684-1' data-testid='fillblank-select-910684-1'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-910684-1'></option><option value=\"Lisa\" data-testid='fillblank-option-910684-1-Lisa'>Lisa</option><option value=\"Peter\" data-testid='fillblank-option-910684-1-Peter'>Peter</option><option value=\"Daniel\" data-testid='fillblank-option-910684-1-Daniel'>Daniel</option></select></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong>Shopping tourism - <span class='fillblank-option'><label>14.3</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-14' index='2' name='fbo-910684-2' data-testid='fillblank-select-910684-2'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-910684-2'></option><option value=\"Lisa\" data-testid='fillblank-option-910684-2-Lisa'>Lisa</option><option value=\"Daniel\" data-testid='fillblank-option-910684-2-Daniel'>Daniel</option><option value=\"Peter\" data-testid='fillblank-option-910684-2-Peter'>Peter</option></select></span></strong></p>",
