      "questionName": "tourism, package, agency, ruinous",
      "questionType": "FillBlank",
      "questionText": "<p><strong>Complete the text by changing the form of the word in capitals.</strong></p>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"/images/exams/16523-2_0b839419.jpg\" alt width=\"400\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.1</label><input id='fbo-910664-0' class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='0' name='fbo-910664-0' type='text' size='11' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-910664-0' /></span> (TOUR)</strong> is growing fast as people love to explore new destinations. Many travelers choose a <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.2</label><input id='fbo-910664-1' class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='1' name='fbo-910664-1' type='text' size='9' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-910664-1' /></span> (PACK)</strong> holiday from a company because it&#8217;s convenient. It usually includes flights, hotels, and guided tours. Historic sites, such as ancient castles or temples, are especially popular. These places show history and attract visitors with their mysterious beauty. For example, you can book a tour at a local travel <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.3</label><input id='fbo-910664-2' class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='2' name='fbo-910664-2' type='text' size='7' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-910664-2' /></span> (AGENT)</strong> to visit a <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.4</label><input id='fbo-910664-3' class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='3' name='fbo-910664-3' type='text' size='9' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-910664-3' /></span> (RUIN)</strong> site like My Son Sanctuary. While there, you can learn about the history of the Cham people from a guide and enjoy taking memorable photos.</p>",
      "passageText": null,
      "parentQuestionId": 0,
      "choices": [],
      "correctChoiceId": null,
